<title>PORTUGAL: Yield falls on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Yield falls on Portugal 5-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Treasury's auction of 20 billion escudos of five-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23.03.01</p>
<p>    COUPON: 8.75 PCT		  AVG ACCEPTED YLD: 7.6288 PCT</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 19.7 BLN ESC   HIGHEST ACCEPTED YLD: 7.64 PCT</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: ANNUAL</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is/is not fungible. The auction takes to 215.53 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
